WEBVTT

00:04:26.595 --> 00:04:30.182
we’ve drifted away
from this notion of care

00:04:30.182 --> 00:04:32.935
and parenting being important work.

00:04:33.102 --> 00:04:35.271
But we need to talk
about these things

00:04:35.271 --> 00:04:40.234
and bring parenting and family life
out into the open,

00:04:40.234 --> 00:04:43.946
because we can't fix problems
that we don't see.

00:04:44.405 --> 00:04:46.615
We can’t fix problems
that we don’t talk about.

00:04:46.699 --> 00:04:49.118
It really doesn’t have to be this hard

00:04:49.118 --> 00:04:51.329
and we can do much more
to support people.